*> The basic demo calls: vectors, pairs and a Callback object.
*> Run with `just run-cobol TARGET=datamunge_ex`.
IDENTIFICATION DIVISION.
PROGRAM-ID. DATAMUNGE-EX.
DATA DIVISION.
WORKING-STORAGE SECTION.
COPY "datamunge.cpy".

01 VEC       USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 MAPPED    USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 CB        USAGE BINARY-DOUBLE UNSIGNED.
01 TAB-CHAR  PIC X VALUE X"09".

*> Number formatting: FORMAT-NUMBER turns NUM into NUM-TEXT(1:NUM-LEN).
01 NUM       USAGE COMP-2.
01 NUM-EDIT  PIC -(12)9.9(10).
01 NUM-TEXT  PIC X(32).
01 NUM-LEN   USAGE BINARY-LONG.

PROCEDURE DIVISION.
    CALL "dm_hello" USING DM-HELLO DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK

    MOVE 1.0 TO DM-MAKE-DVECTOR-A
    MOVE 2.0 TO DM-MAKE-DVECTOR-B
    MOVE 3.0 TO DM-MAKE-DVECTOR-C
    CALL "dm_make_dvector" USING DM-MAKE-DVECTOR DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-MAKE-DVECTOR-RESULT TO VEC
    MOVE VEC TO DM-SUM-DVECTOR-VALUES
    CALL "dm_sum_dvector" USING DM-SUM-DVECTOR DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-SUM-DVECTOR-RESULT TO NUM
    PERFORM FORMAT-NUMBER
    DISPLAY "sum_dvector:" TAB-CHAR NUM-TEXT(1:NUM-LEN)

    *> A pair is flattened into -FIRST and -SECOND fields.
    MOVE 1.25 TO DM-MAKE-DPAIR-A
    MOVE 2.75 TO DM-MAKE-DPAIR-B
    CALL "dm_make_dpair" USING DM-MAKE-DPAIR DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-MAKE-DPAIR-RESULT-FIRST TO DM-SUM-DPAIR-VALUES-FIRST
    MOVE DM-MAKE-DPAIR-RESULT-SECOND TO DM-SUM-DPAIR-VALUES-SECOND
    CALL "dm_sum_dpair" USING DM-SUM-DPAIR DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-SUM-DPAIR-RESULT TO NUM
    PERFORM FORMAT-NUMBER
    DISPLAY "sum_dpair:" TAB-CHAR NUM-TEXT(1:NUM-LEN)

    *> The default Callback returns its input unchanged.
    CALL "dm_callback_new" USING DM-CALLBACK-NEW DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-CALLBACK-NEW-RESULT TO CB
    MOVE 3.0 TO DM-CALL-WITH-CALLBACK-X
    MOVE CB TO DM-CALL-WITH-CALLBACK-CB
    CALL "dm_call_with_callback" USING DM-CALL-WITH-CALLBACK DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-CALL-WITH-CALLBACK-RESULT TO NUM
    PERFORM FORMAT-NUMBER
    DISPLAY "call_with_callback(3.0):" TAB-CHAR NUM-TEXT(1:NUM-LEN)

    MOVE VEC TO DM-MAP-DVECTOR-WITH-CALLBACK-VALUES
    MOVE CB TO DM-MAP-DVECTOR-WITH-CALLBACK-CB
    CALL "dm_map_dvector_with_callback" USING DM-MAP-DVECTOR-WITH-CALLBACK DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-MAP-DVECTOR-WITH-CALLBACK-RESULT TO MAPPED
    MOVE MAPPED TO DM-SUM-DVECTOR-VALUES
    CALL "dm_sum_dvector" USING DM-SUM-DVECTOR DM-STATUS
    PERFORM CHECK
    MOVE DM-SUM-DVECTOR-RESULT TO NUM
    PERFORM FORMAT-NUMBER
    DISPLAY "sum_dvector(map_dvector_with_callback(1,2,3)):" TAB-CHAR NUM-TEXT(1:NUM-LEN)

    MOVE MAPPED TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE VEC TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    MOVE CB TO DM-HANDLE-SELF
    CALL "dm_close" USING DM-HANDLE DM-STATUS
    STOP RUN.

*> Formats NUM without trailing zeros into NUM-TEXT(1:NUM-LEN).
FORMAT-NUMBER.
    COMPUTE NUM-EDIT ROUNDED = NUM
    MOVE FUNCTION TRIM(NUM-EDIT) TO NUM-TEXT
    COMPUTE NUM-LEN = FUNCTION LENGTH(FUNCTION TRIM(NUM-TEXT))
    PERFORM UNTIL NUM-TEXT(NUM-LEN:1) NOT = "0"
        SUBTRACT 1 FROM NUM-LEN
    END-PERFORM
    IF NUM-TEXT(NUM-LEN:1) = "."
        SUBTRACT 1 FROM NUM-LEN
    END-IF.

*> Stops with the error after a failed call.
CHECK.
    IF NOT DM-STATUS-OK
        DISPLAY "datamunge error (" FUNCTION TRIM(DM-STATUS-KIND) "): "
            DM-STATUS-MESSAGE(1:DM-STATUS-LENGTH) UPON SYSERR
        STOP RUN RETURNING 1
    END-IF.
